[thin] These opposite surfaces bound the authentic 1.30 mm cover bezel, CAD Z 17.75–19.05 in its baked manufacturing frame. Its full display opening and spring walls are preserved; current native paths form the supported bezel. This is a retained source section, not a nominal structural-wall exception for the carrier.
alternatives: An outward 1.60 or 2.00 mm bezel can preserve inner snap datums with more stock, but changes source geometry and cooling/stiffness. A solid face removes the opening and these lands. A separately printed larger face frame introduces an attachment interface and replaces the complete source cover.
